---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import { url } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout title="About us">
  <PageHeader
    title="About us"
    eyebrow="Family run since 2000"
    intro="A Hertfordshire building company built on word of mouth and repeat business."
    image="/images/about.jpg"
  />

  <Section>
    <div class="two-col" style="align-items:start">
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">Here at AJH Building contractors we are a family run building company based in Hertfordshire since 2000. Our team have been providing a professional building service which covers all domestic building projects, period refurbishments, building extensions, basements and loft conversions in and around the Hertfordshire area.</p>
        <p>By working in the industry for over 20 years now, we have established an enviable reputation for quality workmanship and with that our business is continuing to grow. A large portion of our business has been generated by word of mouth and AJH standards have in turn gone from strength to strength and continue to grow.</p>
        <p>At AJH our carefully vetted tradesmen who have been part of AJH for many years take 110% pride in their work. This ensures that our standards are consistent and that we deliver every time.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="feature-img" src={url('/images/about.jpg')} alt="A finished kitchen" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section variant="alt">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>AJH offers a complete service for not only the homeowner but also for professional building services. Having worked with many architects over the years we understand the importance of a professional hassle free service which is vital for client relations.</p>
      <p>With all aspects of building works covered by AJH we see the project through from start to finish efficiently and with thorough planning to avoid any potential delays.</p>
      <p>Word of mouth and repeat business has made AJH what it is today and we hope you will allow us the opportunity to show you how our complete service can help your project to be hassle free and swiftly come to fruition. Through our good relationships built with our clients we can also facilitate access to our past projects for you to view.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href={url('/meet-ashley/')}>Meet Ashley, who runs AJH</a>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Layout>
